ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hola, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¿Has venido de tan lejos para
visitar nuestro pueblecito?{{TAG:000A:000B:1009000D00CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ciao, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Hai fatto tutta questa strada
per visitare la nostra città? Bello!{{TAG:000A:000B:1009000D00CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sei gegrüßt, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Du bist den ganzen weiten Weg bis
in unsere Stadt gekommen?{{TAG:000A:000B:1009000D00CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merhaba, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Kasabamızı ziyaret etmek için bunca
yolu mu geldin?{{TAG:000A:000B:1009000D00CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Il se fait tard pour une visite{{TAG:0007:0007:}}...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Qu'est-ce qui t'amène chez nous à
cette heure, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ?{{TAG:000A:000B:100A001000CD}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Is that you, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Come to
visit us at such a LATE hour?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Well, nothing wrong with that.{{TAG:000A:000B:1012001100CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Eres tú, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¿Dónde vas
tan tarde, cielín?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} Aunque
puedes venir cuando quieras, claro.{{TAG:000A:000B:1012001100CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, c'est toi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Quel bon vent t'amène chez nous si
tard, dis-moi ?{{TAG:000A:000B:1012001100CD}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sen misin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bizi böyle GEÇ bir saatte mi ziyarete geldin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Neyse, bunda yanlış bir şey yok.{{TAG:000A:000B:1012001100CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Mira tú por dónde{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Si es {{TAG:0005:0008:}} paseando por el
pueblo a las tantas de la noche.{{TAG:000A:000B:100A001300CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Tu es un véritable oiseau de nuit{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Il est très tard. Quel bon vent
t'amène, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ?{{TAG:000A:000B:100A001300CD}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Everyone likes to come here to
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} when it's raining.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It looks more charming when wet.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}A todo el mundo le encanta
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} cuando llueve.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
¡Parece un pueblo de película!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tutti adorano visitare {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
quando piove.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tutta questa acqua
le dona un certo fascino.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Our town is lovely in the rain,
although it's lovelier when it's not.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Either way, enjoy yourself, OK?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Kasabamız yağmurda çok güzel, gerçi
yağmur yokken daha da güzel.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Her hâlükârda keyfine bak, tamam mı?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I hope you love rain as much as I do.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}We've got plenty of it today,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Maybe you like rainy nights?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}They are pretty in their own...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
unique way, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Te gustan las noches lluviosas?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}La verdad es que son bonitas...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
a su manera, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ti piace stare sotto le coperte
mentre fuori piove, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}È una sensazione...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} rassicurante.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Magst du verregnete Nächte?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich finde, sie haben einen ganz
besonderen Charme, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Belki yağmurlu geceleri seviyorsundur?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Kendilerine göre...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} eşsiz
bir güzellikleri var, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ti hanno detto che questa
non è l'ora di andarsene in giro?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Beh, tu lasciali parlare!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Why wouldn't you visit now?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tasty rain! {{TAG:0007:0000:07000000}}Murky dark! {{TAG:0007:0000:07000000}}It's like the
whole town is a pond, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Qué gran día para visitarnos!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Refrescante {{TAG:0007:0000:07000000}}y húmedo! {{TAG:0007:0000:07000000}}El pueblo
parece un estanque, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Che bella giornata per una visita!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Pioggia! {{TAG:0007:0000:07000000}}Fango! {{TAG:0007:0000:07000000}}La città è un unico
grande stagno, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Şimdi niye ziyaret etmeyesin ki?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Nefis yağmur! {{TAG:0007:0000:07000000}}Kasvetli karanlık! {{TAG:0007:0000:07000000}}
Bütün kasaba gölet gibi, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I was just about to turn in for the
night and dry my soaked clothes.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}But then who'd be here for you?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Vista l'ora, pensavo di tornare
a casa ad asciugare i vestiti bagnati.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ma poi con chi avresti parlato?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tam geceyi kapatıp ıslak
kıyafetlerimi kurutacaktım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ama o zaman seni kim karşılayacak?
